{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"yuanzhang-e-o116","title":"黄初四年诏公卿举独行君子，司徒华歆荐管宁，文帝即位征宁","accounts":[{"id":"yuanzhang-a-50a48d8fa0222f7ba869","label":"正文","text":"黄初四年，司徒华歆荐管宁，文帝即征宁；管宁遂将家属浮海还郡。","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-870cd6af7bf3c206c73f","yuanzhang-q2-5c55926811b00d1b1965"]},{"id":"yuanzhang-a-f05720ed8cdd6f8d807a","label":"正文","text":"管宁遂将家属浮海还郡，公孙恭送之南郊，加赠服物","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-d001cc765ba4361532f4"]},{"id":"yuanzhang-a-cd528625fafc567b5709","label":"正文","text":"管宁受而藏度、康、恭前后所资遗，既已西渡尽封还之","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-ea624a9e4f8c6e81ea55"]},{"id":"yuanzhang-a-53cdf3b7767cba305c6d","label":"裴注·傅子","text":"公孙康死，嫡子不立而立弟恭；管宁曰废嫡立庶下有异心乱之所由起，乃将家属乘海即受征；宁在辽东积三十七年乃归","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-87d4f9c5b0e3f715babb"]},{"id":"yuanzhang-a-c38a0a660fd477f2c286","label":"裴注·傅子","text":"管宁归途海中遇暴风，船皆没唯宁乘船自若；夜风晦冥望见火光趋之得岛，岛无居人又无火烬，行人以为神光之祐；皇甫谧曰积善之应","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-093b09c6157e1c3a725a"]},{"id":"zhonghua-a-d78817710eba2b2dc5e8","label":"正文","text":"黄初中诏公卿举独行君子，华歆举管宁，帝以安东征之","evidence":["zhonghua-q-56166747e6635aa4db2c"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0340","role":"为司徒，荐管宁","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-870cd6af7bf3c206c73f"]},{"person":"wudi-p0170","role":"即位征管宁","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-870cd6af7bf3c206c73f"]},{"person":"huanchen-p0600","role":"被荐被征；将家属浮海还郡；受而藏公孙度、康、恭前后所资遗，既已西渡，尽封还之；曰废嫡立庶下有异心乱之所由起也，乃将家属乘海即受征，在辽东积三十七年乃归；海中遇暴风船皆没唯其乘船自若，望火光趋之得岛，行人咸异以为神光之祐","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-870cd6af7bf3c206c73f","yuanzhang-q-d001cc765ba4361532f4","yuanzhang-q-ea624a9e4f8c6e81ea55","yuanzhang-q-87d4f9c5b0e3f715babb","yuanzhang-q-093b09c6157e1c3a725a"]},{"person":"wendi-p0015","role":"送之南郊，加赠服物；康弟，懦弱，被立","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-d001cc765ba4361532f4","yuanzhang-q-87d4f9c5b0e3f715babb"]},{"person":"wudi-p0247","role":"已死","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-87d4f9c5b0e3f715babb"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["yuanzhang-q-870cd6af7bf3c206c73f","yuanzhang-q-d001cc765ba4361532f4","yuanzhang-q-ea624a9e4f8c6e81ea55","yuanzhang-q-87d4f9c5b0e3f715babb","yuanzhang-q-093b09c6157e1c3a725a"]},"ordering_evidence":"yuanzhang-q-870cd6af7bf3c206c73f","source_order":[11,368,0],"order":2660}],"persons":[{"id":"huanchen-p0600","name":"管宁","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0015","name":"公孙恭","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0170","name":"曹丕","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0247","name":"公孙康","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0340","name":"华歆","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"yuanzhang-q-093b09c6157e1c3a725a","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-1157405894aaf96d21ad","layer":"pei","quote":"宁之归也，海中遇暴风；船皆没，唯宁乘船自若。时夜风晦冥，船人尽惑，莫知所泊。望见有火光，辄趋之，得岛。岛无居人，又无火烬；行人咸异焉，以为神光之祐也。皇甫谧曰：‘积善之应也","attribution":"裴注·傅子","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":449,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4555308644cb020df99a","start":134,"end":220,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-870cd6af7bf3c206c73f","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-ce968cc1eb7efd4702c2","layer":"original","quote":"黄初四年，诏公卿举独行君子〖4〗。司徒华歆荐宁，文帝即（位）征宁","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":367,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":32,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-87d4f9c5b0e3f715babb","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-1157405894aaf96d21ad","layer":"pei","quote":"是时，康又已死，嫡子不立而立弟恭；恭懦弱，而康孽子渊有俊才。宁曰：‘废嫡立庶，下有异心，乱之所由起也。’乃将家属乘海即受征。宁在辽东，积三十七年乃归","attribution":"裴注·傅子","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":449,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4555308644cb020df99a","start":10,"end":84,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-d001cc765ba4361532f4","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-ce968cc1eb7efd4702c2","layer":"original","quote":"遂将家属，浮海还郡〖5〗；公孙恭送之南郊〖6〗，加赠服物","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":367,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":33,"end":61,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-ea624a9e4f8c6e81ea55","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-ce968cc1eb7efd4702c2","layer":"original","quote":"自宁之东也，度、康、恭前后所资遗，皆受而藏诸；既已西渡，尽封还之","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":367,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":65,"end":97,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q2-5c55926811b00d1b1965","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-ce968cc1eb7efd4702c2","layer":"original","quote":"黄初四年，诏公卿举独行君子〖4〗。司徒华歆荐宁，文帝即（位）征宁。遂将家属，浮海还郡〖5〗；公孙恭送之南郊〖6〗，加赠服物〖7〗。自宁之东也，度、康、恭前后所资遗，皆受而藏诸；既已西渡，尽封还之。﹝一﹞诏以宁为太中大夫，固辞不受。﹝二﹞","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":367,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":118,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-56166747e6635aa4db2c","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-a9855a57d7396cfcab6d","layer":"original","quote":"黄初中，诏公卿举独行君子；歆举管宁，帝以安东征之。","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":178,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":25,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
